import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Triangulated.StabilityCondition.Mukai.Basic

/-!
# Quoting a conflict marker

A docstring is allowed to quote what a conflict looks like, indented as a code
block, the way `CLAUDE.md` and this checker's own source do:

    <<<<<<< HEAD
    =======
    >>>>>>> other

None of those are at the start of a line, so none of them is a marker. This
fixture pins the column-0 anchoring; without it the early substring scan would
never reach the per-line test.
-/
